      "text": "API Contracts: ( According to the users flow ) ",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "API Contracts: ( According to the users flow ) ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "7-7PKTfuqo5IWmI-r2FvY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -3448.8225771425514,
      "y": -5416.305422932983,
      "width": 1930.0673828125,
      "height": 855,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "GirOwbZjqecnj6DbrXw0E"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4Q",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 655128282,
      "version": 2275,
      "versionNonce": 601053722,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783946132661,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "User Auth :\nPOST -> auth/verify ->  payload=email -> magic link send \nPOST -> auth/signup -> payload= userdata + token from magic link -> access token + refresh tokens + role\nPOST -> auth/login   -> payload=email + pass -> access token + refresh tokens + role\nPOST -> auth/refresh -> payload=refreshtoken -> access token + refresh token (blacklist refreshtoken)\n\nUser Search : Movies, Theatres\nGET -> search/?input={str}&location={str}\n\nUser Browse: V\nMOVIE -> THEATRE -> MOVIES SHOWS -> SEATS \nx) GET -> theatre/{theatre.id} -> list of movies \ny) GET -> movie/{movie.id} -> list of theatres \n    [x | y => z => w]\nz) GET -> movie/{movie.id}/{theatre.id} -> list of movie shows \nw) GET -> movie/{movie.id}/{theatre.id}/{show.id} -> list of seats available \n\nPOST -> movie/{movie.id}/{theatre.id}/{show.id} -> payload = rownum + colnum (Example, A3,C9,...) -> reserve\nPOST -> movie/{movie.id}/{theatre.id}/{show.id}/{seat.id}/payment -> ticket link ",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "User Auth :\nPOST -> auth/verify ->  payload=email -> magic link send \nPOST -> auth/signup -> payload= userdata + token from magic link -> access token + refresh tokens + role\nPOST -> auth/login   -> payload=email + pass -> access token + refresh tokens + role\nPOST -> auth/refresh -> payload=refreshtoken -> access token + refresh token (blacklist refreshtoken)\n\nUser Search : Movies, Theatres\nGET -> search/?input={str}&location={str}\n\nUser Browse: V\nMOVIE -> THEATRE -> MOVIES SHOWS -> SEATS \nx) GET -> theatre/{theatre.id} -> list of movies \ny) GET -> movie/{movie.id} -> list of theatres \n    [x | y => z => w]\nz) GET -> movie/{movie.id}/{theatre.id} -> list of movie shows \nw) GET -> movie/{movie.id}/{theatre.id}/{show.id} -> list of seats available \n\nPOST -> movie/{movie.id}/{theatre.id}/{show.id} -> payload = rownum + colnum (Example, A3,C9,...) -> reserve\nPOST -> movie/{movie.id}/{theatre.id}/{show.id}/{seat.id}/payment -> ticket link ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "LjDAvPp-jwTF-60-iyIp2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1415.2368677977784,
      "y": -5476.748225362182,
      "width": 1510.6314697265625,
      "height": 900,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
